# The temporal dataset's data files, until the schema settles. D4 says they
# belong in git, and they will: committing 349 MB before the schema is final
# means rewriting all 20 region files when it changes, and the same weight
# again, permanently, in history. Rebuild them with
# `python -m scripts.build_temporal build`. SCHEMA.md and INDEX.csv beside them
# are tracked, because they are documentation and index, not payload.
temporal/comuni/
